SUMMARY:Les Rendez-vous de la HEG-Genève : De l’IA aux résultats
LOCATION:HEG-Genève\, Campus Battelle\, Rue de la Tambourine 17\, Carouge 
 (Geneva)
DESCRIPTION:Round table in which four organisations present AI initiatives 
 that moved past the pilot stage to measurable business impact — the orga
 nisers promise fewer speeches and more lived experience — followed by a 
 cocktail.\n\nOrganiser: HEG-Genève / Observatoire Data & IA (with Oracle 
 and Colombus Consulting)\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataeve
 nts.ch/events/heg-geneve-de-lia-aux-resultats-2026/
